      <h2>Enquiries and appointments</h2>
      <p>
        Sending a message through the contact form is an enquiry and does not guarantee an appointment. Appointments, pricing, deposits, rescheduling and cancellations are agreed directly with the studio and confirmed at the time of booking. You must be at least 18 years old, and you may be asked to show valid photo identification before a session.
