        Tattooing carries risks, including infection, allergic reaction and scarring. The information on this site, including the aftercare guidance, is general and is not medical advice. If you have a medical condition, are pregnant or are taking medication that may affect healing, speak to your doctor before booking. Contact a medical professional if you think a tattoo has become infected.
